[B]Lite support is community-tier and best-effort.[/B] Bug reports and configuration questions are welcome on GitHub. To help me reproduce, please include your server version, RTP version, platform, the relevant config files (`config.yml`, `regions/`, `safety.yml`), and the relevant `server.log` section. Reports without these will be asked for them; if there's no follow-up, the issue will be closed and can be reopened later. Priority and response-time guarantees are reserved for [B]RTP-Pro[/B].

[I]Unsupported in Lite:[/I] Fabric (planned for a later release), native Forge / NeoForge (use officially-supported Arclight or Mohist), plugin conflicts I can't reproduce, and general Minecraft-server administration questions.

